  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlīla kwa ng'wa Hana kwigwiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha ūmò wa Lamasaimu-zofimu, ya kū magūlya ga sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu. Ī lina lyakwe walī Elikana, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yelohamu, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Elihu, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Tohu, ng'wana Zufu; ūmò wa banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na mhalī ya bakīma babīlī; ūmò witanagwa Hana, ūngī Penina. Ū Penina walī na baana, alīyo ū Hana walī gūmba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ng'wenūyo būlī ng'waka wajaga Shilo kūnamya SEEBA Ndūji wa shose, na kūfunya shitambò kwenūko; bitūnja ba ng'wa Eli ba Hofuni na Finehasi baatūmamaga nīmo gwa būgabīji kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyabizaga ūlū lyashika ī likanza lya kūfunya shitambò, ū Elikana wang'winhaga ū nke wakwe ū Penina ibudīka lya nyama hamò na a baana bakwe bose pye, bagosha na bakīma, wabagabanhyaga būlī ng'wene ibudīka lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Hana wang'winhaga ibudīka lya būtaale wa ng'hangala ibīlī, nguno walī antogilwe no, nūūlū īkī ū SEEBA walī wanugalīla ū būbyīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkī ū SEEBA walī wanugalīla ū būbyīle, ū nke ng'wiye wampīnīhajaga no, kūlwa nguno ya kūmanūng'wikoloosha būlī makanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabīta myaka mingī akūkoyiagwa gīko. Būl'ikanza ū Hana ūlū waja ū kū numba ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū nke ng'wiye wang'wikolooshaga no, kūshisha walīla wakalemeelwa nū kūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wapīnīhala gīko ū ngoshi wakwe ū Elikana wang'wīlaga, “Hana nibūlī ūlīīlīla? Ni kinehe ūtūlyaga? Yapīnīhajiagwa kī ī ng'holò yako? Angū, ū nene natī wa mpango ntaale ū kūlī bebe kūtinda nūūlū kūbiza na baana bagosha mpungatī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lwise lūmò aho balī Shilo, bahayūmala kūlya na kūng'wa, ū Hana ūbūūka. Ī likanza lyenīlo ū ngabīji Eli walī wigasha h'isumbī ha nyango gwa kwingīla mu hekalu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hekalu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū Numba, nūūlū ipandi lya kwikala.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hana wandya kūlīla na kūnomba ū SEEBA kūlwa būpīna būtaale ūbo wankoyaga mu ng'holò yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlahīla shilahīlo alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA Ndūji wa shose, ūlū ūbūlola ū būpīna wa nsese wako ūnizūkwa nane, ooya ū kūng'wība ū nsese wako, alīyo ūng'winha ng'wana ngosha; a henaho nū nene nakūng'winha ū ng'wana ng'wenūyo kūlī SEEBA shikū jose ja būlamu wakwe. Na lūtalabīta lūgembe lose lose ū mu ntwe gwakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho akūlombaga, ū Eli walī wanola ū kū nomo gwakwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Hana walombelaga mu ng'holò, ī lilaka lyalī lītaafumaga, gwabeya beyaga nomo dūhū. Ū Eli wiganika gīkī ū nkīma ng'wenūyo walī wang'wa walwa ūleewa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na lūūlū ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe ūkūyikala ūleebilwe kūshisha nanalī? Lekanaga nayo ī divai!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Hana ūnshokeja ūhaya, “Ītī gīko baba, ū nene nalī na būpīna no, natang'wile divai nūūlū walwa; naliita būpanga wane kūlī SEEBA dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtizūng'wiganikīla ū nsese wako gīkī alī ūmò wa bakīma bahūnga; a henaha nalūlombaga kūlwa nguno ya kūzwangana hamò na būpīna wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Eli ūng'wīla, “Jaga mu mhola, ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli akwīlūkīle īyo wanombaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hana ūshosha, “Ū nsese wako ni anukūlagwe ū mu miso gako.” Na lūūlū wīnga ho, ūja kūlya shilīwa, wiluguta nū būshū wakwe; būshila ū būpīna wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho būmisha dilū būnamya SEEBA, hūna būbūūka bashokile kū kaya yabo Lama. Ū Elikana aho walaala nū nke wakwe ū Hana, ū SEEBA ūng'wizūkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashikīīla ī likanza ū Hana ūbūūcha nda, ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Sang'weli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sang'weli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī lina lyenīlo ū mu Shihebulania līlī gītī Kwigwiwa na Mulungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akūhayaga, “Nguno nakanomba kūlī SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli kūtūūlwa kūlī SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū munhū ng'wenūyo ū Elikana ūja nī kaya yakwe ī yose kūjūfunya shitambò sha būlī ng'waka kūlī SEEBA na kūshikīlīja shilahīlo shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Hana atajile; ūng'wīla ū ngoshi, “Ū nyanda ūlū alaagile nakūntwala nakantūūle kūlī Seba, wikale kwenūko shikū jose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngoshi ū Elikana ūng'wīla, “Ītaga yose yose īyo ūlībona īlīkūbeelela; ikalaga ūlembeele kūshisha ūngije ū nīgīnī, gwike dūhū ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ni gūshikīīlage.” Na lūūlū ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wikala ha kaya, ūng'onhya ū ng'wana kūshisha ūngija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wangija ūntwala, nūūlū īkī walī ataalī ndo; ūjana na nzagamba ya myaka idatū, hamò na'idebbe lya būsu, na shisaabo sha divai; shose ūshijana Shilo ū kū numba ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baamala ū kwīsīnza ī nzagamba, būntwala kūlī Eli ū nyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
