              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hana ūshika ūhaya, “Kūlaga ūhangame baba; ū nene hū nalī nkīma ūyo naalī nīmīīla henaha bbihī nang'ho nakūlombaga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanombaga ū SEEBA aninhe ū ng'wana ng'wenūyū, na ng'hana ū SEEBA waninhile gīt'ūmo naalī nanombela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha nalīng'winha kūlī SEEBA ū nyanda ng'wenūyū; ū mu shikū jose ja būlamu wakwe wabizaga o ng'wa SEEBA.” Ū nyanda wikala kwenūko ūbiza namya o ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
